ice officer.\n\nFinally, the job of the person at position 2, who likes thriller movies, cannot be determined directly from the given conditions. But since the person at position 2 is a police officer, and since each person has a unique job, the person at position 1 (who is a journalist) cannot also be the one who likes thriller movies. Therefore, the person at position 2 must be the one who likes thriller movies.\n\nAnswer:\n<solution>The person who watches adventure is at position 2, the hobby of the person at position 1 (journalist) is filmmaking, the job of the person at position 2 (adventure lover) is police-officer, the job of the person at position 2 (thriller lover) is thriller.</solution>\n\nFinal answer: The person who watches adventure is at position 2, the hobby of the person at position 1 (journalist) is filmmaking, the job of the person at position 2 (adventure lover) is police-officer, and the job of the person at position 2 (thriller lover) is thriller.", "logprobs": [{"token": "Solution", "logprob": -0.001567802974022925}, {"token": ":", "logprob": -2.145764938177308e-06}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.0005117537220939994}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.012994960881769657}, {"token": "First", "logprob": -0.7354749441146851}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.001291037304326892}, {"token": "let", "logprob": -0.001191621064208448}, {"token": "'", "logprob": -2.264974000354414e-06}, {"token": "s", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "consider", "logprob": -0.14262878894805908}, {"token": "the", "logprob": -0.0003530356043484062}, {"token": "position", "logprob": -0.4651504158973694}, {"token": "of", "logprob": -2.264974000354414e-06}, {"token": "the", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "person", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "who", "logprob": -1.1920928244535389e-07}, {"token": "watches", "logprob": -0.0011651878012344241}, {"token": "adventure", "logprob": -0.0002406545972917229}, {"token": "movies", "logprob": -0.6934923529624939}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -0.00046838278649